## HIL Incubator — Landing / Orientation Page

**File:** `hil-incubator-generator.html`
**URL:** `hilsystem.com/tools/hil-incubator-generator.html`
**Status:** Live (landing page only) — generator not built

**Purpose:** HIL Guild's onboarding landing page for the Incubator (Wiki.js-hosted personal knowledge system). Explains the concept, orients new members, and presents four "Start Here" quest cards. Wired into `hil-shell.js` (header/nav/PATCH bubble) and `session-logger.js` (Time-only scoring) as of this pass.

**⚠️ Scope correction (this version):** A prior README version (v1.0.0, dated 2026-07-16) described a fully-built three-step onboarding + markdown generator — Identity form, 12-tile Tier Picker, and a two-tab Generator producing STD-WIKI-001 compliant pages. **That was never actually built.** The live file has always been landing/marketing content only — zero `<script>` tags, no Identity/Tier Picker/Generator markup. The prior README was ahead of the code, not behind it. That spec is still good and can serve as the build brief whenever the real generator gets built — see "Not yet built" below.

**Companion file referenced by the old README (`hil-incubator-wiki-home.html`) does not exist** — confirmed 404 against the repo. If/when it's built, document it separately; don't assume it from this file.

